      "text": "as rockstar built everything from the ground up after GTA SA ( as the trilogy\nwas completed) for GTA IV, if rockstar were to do the same thing for the next\nGTA ( GTA VII) what do you think they would introduce in the next complete\nfrom ground up made GTA game that would it make feel like a gigantic step\nforward in immersion that gta 4 felt to san andreas, give a long and detailed ans",
