      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "targets may have some default states, which this design pattern\nimplements usign a director which manages builders. So that pre-existing\ndefault states which are required again and again are stored beforehand",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "targets may have some default states, which this design pattern implements usign a director which manages builders. So that pre-existing default states which are required again and again are stored beforehand",
